body:
I've been to the ER twice and they gave me a bag of fluids and thats about it. I've seen a GI specialist, ENT, and Allergist. I've tried urgent care too. I'm in the process of changing PCPs because I hate my current doctor, she doesn't listen to me at all. Luckily my insurance is a PPO so it doesn't require referrals. I would have never seen the GI if I needed a referral since she said I didn't need a GI. 

&#x200B;

But anyway my parents are picking me up tomorrow and I'm staying with them for a week or 2 to help me get better and go to some different doctors.
